<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle debt at 7.2 bln Sfr at end-Oct.</title>
<headline>Nestle debt at 7.2 bln Sfr at end-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>VEVEY, Switzerland 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nestle SA said its net debt dipped to 7.2 billion Swiss francs at the end of October from 8.2 billion at the end of June.</p>
<p>At the end of 1995 it was 6.3 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>The company presented the figures during release of its 10-month results.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
